<title>UK: Dreyfus extends processing deal at German refinery.</title>
<headline>Dreyfus extends processing deal at German refinery.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louis Dreyfus Corp has extended its agreement to process crude oil at the Beta refinery in Wilhelmshaven, Germany until April 3, 1997, sources familar with the deal said on Friday.</p>
</text>
